        <obo:NCIT_P108>Cervical</obo:NCIT_P108>
        <obo:NCIT_P207>C0205064</obo:NCIT_P207>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>Relating to the neck, or to the neck of any organ or structure. Cervical lymph nodes are located in the neck; cervical cancer refers to cancer of the uterine cervix, which is the lower, narrow end (the &quot;neck&quot;) of the uterus.</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P366>Cervical</obo:NCIT_P366>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Cervical</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
