        <obo:NCIT_P322>CTRP</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>Describes the relative amount of different tissues present in the breast. A dense breast has less fat than glandular and connective tissue. Mammogram films of breasts with higher density are harder to read and interpret than those of less dense breasts.</obo:NCIT_P325>
